Package: miadi-music-render
Version: 0.1.0
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: abcmidi, abcm2ps, librsvg2-bin, fluidsynth, fluid-soundfont-gm, ffmpeg, lame
Recommends: rubberband-cli, sox
Maintainer: Miadi <mia@jgwill.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/jgwill/miadi-orchestration-kit
Description: Score to sound on a Miadi host: ABC, MIDI, audio and the engraved page
 The tools every Miadi music workflow renders through, for an album track
 as for the score of an episode:
  abc2midi      an ABC score to MIDI
  abcm2ps       an ABC score to an engraved page; rsvg-convert makes the PNG
  fluidsynth    MIDI to audio, with the FluidR3 General MIDI soundfont
  ffmpeg, lame  probing, crops, mixing and MP3
 rubberband-cli (pitch-shifted sample instruments) and sox are recommended.
